{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_title", "source_sha256": "6cbe85ddd16c70d3106a7e529c0b7675757c64687fb5ed36e45e384789e325c0", "ja": "夢の黎明", "zh": "梦的黎明", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_synopsis", "source_sha256": "630fd51979bd56ef877524df86d4db9a65320674631cd6089a212ec35d84a600", "ja": "新曲をもらった事を、喜んで父親に報告する\n静香。だが成果とは認められず、「アイドル\nは中学生まで」と念を押される。焦る静香\nだったが、プロデューサーと仲間達の支えを\n受け、自身の夢に向かって再び走り出す。", "zh": "静香开心地向父亲报告自己拿到了新歌。\n然而父亲却不认可这是成果，并叮嘱她\n“偶像只能当到初中为止”。感到焦急的\n静香在制作人与同伴们的支持下，\n重新奔向了自己的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff778001594191d7c35dbcc08c8a1534533ed795acb756e96ce51e4ba6c46bbe", "ja": "（公演に向けてのレッスンは、順調に進んでいる。\n静香も、今日は朝から張り切っているみたいだな……）", "zh": "（面向公演的排练进展得很顺利。静香今天好像从早上开始就干劲十足……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1001_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "580b0233a246f95a2631aca2fd26337b3a7dcb9adb6473424b31552f02e07345", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さん！\n今、お時間ありますか？", "zh": "啊、那个，{$P$}先生！\n您现在有时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bc5c6ef1e18bde351cb2bd9d2158882286b2a0199c4f63e905afb492e64b705b", "ja": "あれ、星梨花。紬も……\n今は、静香達とレッスンの時間じゃなかったか？", "zh": "咦，星梨花。紬也在……\n现在不是和静香她们练习的时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dd6b7358785da99fc712514e2460a9f19277096629834576551bcad5d87bc6e1", "ja": "そのとおりです。あなたという方は……\n知っているなら、何故レッスンを見に来ないのですか？", "zh": "正是如此。您明明知道……为什么不来观看我们的练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1005_p", "source_sha256": "600c926a517a1d793fbb9869df11885c1690c0ecbf54f2741ba1ffa3400e27f4", "ja": "いや、今から行こうと思ってたんだけど……\nそれより、何か問題か？", "zh": "不是，我正打算现在过去呢……\n先不说这个，出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "960b45ee5e9125b59f57b4b8b886ea2f052b1e649818df6c648e8d217bbac2ae", "ja": "はい。……あの、静香さん、なんだか調子が悪そうで。\n{$P$}さん、何か知ってますか？", "zh": "是的……那个，静香小姐好像有点不舒服。\n{$P$}先生，您知道些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1007_p", "source_sha256": "449dbdfc88ef17057094a426602fcb117217043131435820e6c1d66f7474d095", "ja": "え……静香が？\nいや、特に何も聞いてないけど……。", "zh": "诶……静香她？  \n不，我没听说有什么特别的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "33c2567229ef35c23cbf02147ab11519feab25c0c1dcf215fd42e55030a3f13e", "ja": "最上さん……新曲を歌えると聞いた時は、\nあんなにも、うれしそうだったのに。", "zh": "最上小姐……听说能唱新曲的时候，\n明明那么开心的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dc9ad8b45e77aefba112bc44b054275524e72deba52a4ac5ab2592c5a26b2a1a", "ja": "{$P$}。\n本当に、心当たりはないのですか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n真的一点头绪都没有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "c554151377d431259ba312465d54d3cfe18889f8421b5f80c41311e49baeb747", "ja": "体調が悪いんじゃないとしたら……\n静香さん、何か、悩みがあるんでしょうか……？", "zh": "如果不是身体不舒服的话……\n静香，你是不是有什么烦恼呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1011_p", "source_sha256": "45db4e324b1ac67216b45d10ff58fa7ce846b39afcc34f6d2593a80e518b0f71", "ja": "なるほど……そうか。ふたりとも、教えてくれて\nありがとう。ちょっと、様子を見てくる。", "zh": "原来如此……这样啊。谢谢你们两位告诉我。我去看看她的情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "38b861f509f7c231c2836b282adabd2c087a3240b66e90b4e97a9583902d53f3", "ja": "は、はい！　お願いします！", "zh": "是、是的！那就拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e505f6326306e2615bd14be5199d2851498b490ab2283fcb33de55d1b34818ce", "ja": "くれぐれも、私と箱崎さんから何か聞いた……とは、\nおっしゃらないでくださいね。", "zh": "请千万不要说……您是从我和箱崎小姐这里听到了什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "b54a9ff4e97adb4b58f25774b74da976bbbc51cbb0bba875b5eb3c13220cd41e", "ja": "だから、私ならまだやれるって言ってるでしょ！\n……未来、もう一回お願い！　通してやりたいの！", "zh": "所以我不是说了嘛，我还可以继续的！\n……未来，再拜托你一次！我想让它通过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "a1427bb8de546b7c89cec31f1422de0333d3f9570c7088bdd78b68e964bd9dad", "ja": "でも、静香ちゃん……！", "zh": "可是，静香……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1482cb8c40914aef8c39297e04cfb38bf8b88aa27345bac332b83bdefcc30fb5", "ja": "（この声は……静香と、未来か？）", "zh": "（这个声音是……静香和未来吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "336ffa9473f86898ede015ea70f1e8c80bbce455ae04d575956e7f658ba3b62c", "ja": "でも静香ちゃん、さっきからずっと歌いっぱなしだよ？\n絶対、休んだほうがいいと思う！", "zh": "可是静香从刚才开始就一直在唱歌啊？我觉得你绝对应该休息一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "6a2e1ac88bbdcb8685e7b807070406233dc8f0b0dc869f9611955ec7ef7c3550", "ja": "あたしも、それがいいと思う。\nな、シズ？", "zh": "我也觉得那样比较好。\n对吧，静香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "897034e8665cf2eee5988c1dad91453b5bd1945ebac469ddc31f6c875b77a5ee", "ja": "いえ！　私なら、大丈夫です。\nもっと、練習しないと。同じところじゃ……。", "zh": "不！　我没事的。\n我还得加紧练习才行。在同一个地方可不能……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "663ceb5e7fd0bbc6c0437efe1effe77dd0b666498c8fd854d0a472429d97e825", "ja": "シズ……？", "zh": "静……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1022_p", "source_sha256": "fe87e3440a4cbdbc610894081cbba06f7611de039291d60d1e423a280e8b67a1", "ja": "お疲れさま。俺も、ふたりの意見に賛成かな。\n静香、少し休んだ方がいい。", "zh": "辛苦了。我也赞成你们两个的意见。\n静香，还是稍微休息一下比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "5c4a590bb1537bcbd55207954e072a94d70e1f2dc3c503661192555ba497a4a6", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}。いえ、平気です！\nまだ体力的にも余裕がありますし、問題ありません。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}。不，我没事！\n体力上也还有余裕，没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9600e0eddf39f132c42a6e0de9517755d6e95bb5961db59ac6b9c9663edf74f2", "ja": "体力に余裕があっても、だ。\n無理をすれば後に響く。", "zh": "就算体力还很充沛，也一样。\n勉强下去会影响之后的状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "c5ab38572300ed49af62f1f6e19e8570bddec44430453115ad9dd58e287a4ced", "ja": "だから、平気だって言ってるじゃないですか！\n自分の体調は、自分が一番わかってます！", "zh": "所以我不是说没事吗！\n自己的身体状况，我自己最清楚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "1fd3086e5adb0c188c726e17849d899bd7fbf116521f1827bd6764d91a87e087", "ja": "お願いですから、レッスンを続けさせてください！\n私には、時間がないんです……！", "zh": "拜托了，请让我继续训练吧！\n我已经没有时间了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a25521b6905770efcd0a623030cd0be47c8aa834a4a6d4b9cb5dc6c7e08e383e", "ja": "……ダメだ。今の状態の静香に、任せる事はできない。\n何か心配事があるなら、まずは話してほしい。", "zh": "……不行。我不能把工作交给现在的你。\n要是有什么担心的事，先跟我说说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "66bde6d2ca9525fc18889eb79ce621374e4823be2d9d9c9b1dad7b7d97a93bda", "ja": "……っ！　でも……！", "zh": "……！　可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "cfbcf2995e7b3c9aea10d1f7dcbd87747b33c64ca4002a61219ed9c159eac2c6", "ja": "なら、ウチらは席を外すよ。だからシズ、\n{$P$}とゆっくり話しな。", "zh": "那我们就先回避一下。静香，你和{$P$}慢慢聊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "d97afc8bf645be34f50b3eff9dd0aac14b03c3ca1d377ab8b21b992dc790fe49", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。あの、\n静香ちゃんのこと、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……那个，静香就拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "3b9e4b69ddef1b5f9655c28f053a30d1e5a5c8dd37125b0011fbf09abe98c7ef", "ja": "え！？　ふたりとも、待って……。\nもう！　{$P$}のせいですよ！？", "zh": "诶！？你们两个，等一下……。\n真是的！都怪{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "cadd409bb97a836d89658c1cf35c192374057044a908d5bfb495d8c1aec0c8db", "ja": "どうしてレッスンを中断させるんですか！　私は、\n次の公演を完璧にしなくちゃいけないのに……！", "zh": "为什么要让训练中断啊！我明明必须把下一场演出做到完美才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1033_p", "source_sha256": "1f09282c58bd31fb48e0e03b041839c496aa05f9d3a986df870980742b241473", "ja": "なあ、静香。新曲を初めて聴いた時、静香は\nすごく楽しそうだったな。公演が楽しみだって……。", "zh": "静香，第一次听到新歌的时候，你看起来特别开心。还说很期待演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1035_p", "source_sha256": "30670a924df5b2f291b21f16184d54c7619cbb1832e246624a50deef1b9bc434", "ja": "けど今は、何だかすごく辛そうに見える。\n……一体、何があったんだ？", "zh": "可是现在，你看起来却好像很难受。\n……到底发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "f205f0151c36edea386786409c907cd8a967f6b7651f4553cc760db37a3fbb1c", "ja": "……。\n{$P$}。私……。", "zh": "……\n{$P$}先生。我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1037_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "28400b47f558201b105ae35360ebc447618d3638e5671345dc6ca0968f957d1c", "ja": "……父に、次の公演について報告したんです。\n新曲をもらったのが、本当にうれしくて……。", "zh": "……我向父亲汇报了关于下次公演的事。\n因为拿到了新歌，真的太高兴了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "025ac178696fac19cae30a0a3467189270d013d31d5dd7a68d8b5f9bcefad772", "ja": "けど父は、これくらいじゃアイドルとして結果を\n残せたとは言えないって。公演にも、来ないって……。", "zh": "可是父亲说，这样还不能算是作为偶像取得了成绩。还说他也不会来看演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1040_p", "source_sha256": "d5f951a82764b685d6d7f7078703417dd79862bce93187a6e28885978ddecfb7", "ja": "それは……結果を残さなければ、中学までしか\nアイドルを続けられないっていう、約束の話だな。", "zh": "那是……如果无法做出成绩，就只能当偶像到初中毕业为止——你说的是这个约定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "a30caf3797f96ab03cd809e6436220d3587176dd61c101ce4b874c13a72496ce", "ja": "はい。……だから私、父に認めてもらえるように、\n曲と向き合って全力で歌いたいって思いました。", "zh": "是的……所以我想认真面对歌曲，全力歌唱，好让父亲认可我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1042_015siz", "source_sha256": "252caa0d217ba29b6abe5d8bb06054801b39759d6f26619054b5cd819632b27b", "ja": "だから、次の公演は絶対に成功させなくちゃ。私は\n同じところにいるんじゃないって、父に示さないと。", "zh": "所以，下一场公演一定要成功才行。我必须向父亲证明，我已经不在原地踏步了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "859263319ef6c493e27c7b2394bf122f4263be309aca1a10d1ed69120d4ea940", "ja": "次の公演が成功すれば、夢が近づいて。絶対に\n叶えられるって、私自身、信じられるかもって……！", "zh": "只要下一场公演成功，梦想就会更接近我。我也许就能相信，自己一定能够实现它……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1044_p", "source_sha256": "74bc3382d632fc1f821cdc65992906c332f18baf2720d5866f294455e85647af", "ja": "静香……。", "zh": "静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "2d01b97b373eda7c4dbb9d4b94f9dab35b3433055750c2ecbf10cc77f91bf4dd", "ja": "{$P$}。新しい歌は、夢に向かって\nまっすぐに進もうとする気持ちを歌ったものですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}。这首新歌，唱的是想要笔直地朝着梦想前进的心情，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "5c424d42090f80451753410ca9e447216b27d3e48789f0cd29f7a322793970a2", "ja": "夢は絶対に叶うって、強く信じる。信じて動くことで、\nまた夢に近づいていく。……とても、素敵な曲です。", "zh": "坚信梦想一定会实现。只要深信并付诸行动，\n就会向着梦想更进一步。……真是一首，非常棒的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "351bbc82e27c69904933554e724bfdac8387b0464100793b06ad398674792c9a", "ja": "だけど今の私は、そうじゃない。\n父に言われた言葉で揺らいで、不安になって……。", "zh": "可是现在的我，并不是这样。\n因为父亲说的话而动摇，变得不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1048_p", "source_sha256": "c997f6a42cbf3462c412c6843c900a528bcfce762585695ac6f786ce486a0d99", "ja": "それは当然だよ。知らない人に言われるより、\nお父さんに夢を否定される方が辛いのは、当たり前だ。", "zh": "那是当然的。比起被陌生人那么说，被父亲否定梦想更难受，这是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1049_015siz", "source_sha256": "0a5edf3ee0c336c847e71e92a4797701375ae76492146e041d163b5a3dccd44b", "ja": "いいえ。私が、弱いんです。私はこの曲のように、\n強い気持ちで夢を追うことができません……。", "zh": "不。是我太软弱了。我做不到像这首歌一样，\n带着坚定的信念去追逐梦想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1050_015siz", "source_sha256": "8b91073e7fee10855b15e0de1a9c34e236247fc68a893dee411841b7663fa621", "ja": "こんな気持ちのまま、私はこの歌を歌えません……！\nでも歌わないと、前には進めない……！", "zh": "保持这样的心情，我没法唱这首歌……！\n可是如果不唱，就无法继续前进……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1051_p", "source_sha256": "74bc3382d632fc1f821cdc65992906c332f18baf2720d5866f294455e85647af", "ja": "静香……。", "zh": "静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1052_015siz", "source_sha256": "0075b1e576ded75a2b1e2a684f1930786d4ca7b42d7488772e0cf9c36a6b5aae", "ja": "{$P$}。私……\nトップアイドルになれなかったら……どうしよう……。", "zh": "{$P$}。我……要是没能成为顶尖偶像……该怎么办……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1053_015siz", "source_sha256": "89b3fc8300e39c6db9c49cb2969374d500c49e083949ca5af8feb880bc2bc0ed", "ja": "本当はすごく、怖いんです。もしかしたら本当に、\n私には無理なんじゃないかって考えちゃって……。", "zh": "其实我真的很害怕。总会忍不住想，说不定我真的做不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1054_p", "source_sha256": "b3d34ce284c2f9b511a01ff4a8f95e0e90589edb7a13a91f9fb61bbcad94af9e", "ja": "静香！　そんな事は……！", "zh": "静香！不是那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1055_014mir", "source_sha256": "bc5b5867a96adca76af07c243f2e91c243e887ce9648662b2be1b49f0aaa87f7", "ja": "そんなことないよっ！", "zh": "才不是那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1056_050jul", "source_sha256": "387da4c3a6a4171c1db059abc4adb1fef86333c84752c3564b89c667055a10d3", "ja": "なっ……バカ、未来！", "zh": "什……笨蛋，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1057_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1058_015siz", "source_sha256": "88fb617defd9083bb008bec2a68d469e4986ccca53f83e9dcf5cd4ca169b49ed", "ja": "えっ……未来！？　き、聞いてたの！？\nジュリアさんも……。", "zh": "咦……未来！？你、你都听到了！？\n茱莉亚先生也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1059_014mir", "source_sha256": "66ebc7c3e12abaf495da6e888347d470e8d55e23f7c2f8a3ea962987a41b6fcc", "ja": "静香ちゃんは、トップアイドルになれるもんっ！\nだから諦めるなんて、そんなの絶対ダメだよ！", "zh": "静香一定能成为顶尖偶像的！\n所以，放弃什么的，绝对不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1060_014mir", "source_sha256": "a4cbc9a21590a9e58f07dc8248ea34f9ebc6fb3dee3b52216b788bce610017d4", "ja": "それでずっと、一緒にアイドル続けるんだよ！\n絶対……歌うの辞めちゃ、ダメだよ！　ダメだもんっ！", "zh": "所以要一直一起当偶像下去哦！\n绝对……不可以放弃唱歌！不可以嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1061_015siz", "source_sha256": "1c539a148169a5306945dbb8a209ad19bbf942a9741e3d9fdbe93c35bd1864bd", "ja": "未来……でも、私……。", "zh": "未来……可是，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1062_014mir", "source_sha256": "a1e07dabb5c1fab14af5bc9f5a5281b89a4a6ad4dc60b8cf1cf57992dfdca718", "ja": "うぅ……ねえ、静香ちゃん、どうして？\nどうして信じられないの？", "zh": "呜呜……呐，静香，你为什么？\n为什么不能相信我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1063_015siz", "source_sha256": "13dd91e33a4125d613f38d3de39818197d56641e22c98bc208e15a7e35bd8af1", "ja": "それは……だって。将来がどうなるかなんて、\n誰にもわからないじゃない……！", "zh": "那是因为……毕竟，谁也不知道将来会变成什么样，不是吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1064_014mir", "source_sha256": "83208aa47013568c3415f7e00495e9fc5fd0af3c7836325a8e324f8110f5e0c5", "ja": "わかるよ！　だって私、ずっと隣で見てたんだよ？\n静香ちゃんは絶対、トップアイドルになれるもん！", "zh": "我明白的！因为我一直都在你身边看着呀？\n静香一定能成为顶尖偶像的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1065_015siz", "source_sha256": "0393539faa28ca67d77d8b67d1f112e5172d2cfa36b47a2193b119f6016b6566", "ja": "そ、そんなの……\n私だって、信じたい。信じたいけど……。", "zh": "那、那种事……\n我也想相信。我想相信，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1066_050jul", "source_sha256": "2441665bd2541c753ac271cef44021ac128793033db4e273bb5a32f1d958e848", "ja": "シズ、未来……\nふたりとも、すこし落ち着けよ。な？", "zh": "静香、未来……\n你们两个都稍微冷静一下，行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1067_022ser", "source_sha256": "46c1f72d310c6f5a7fadcf013e24281dafe127f211bd6368573537c93dae35b1", "ja": "未来さん、静香さん……！\nあの、どうしたんですか！？", "zh": "未来，静香……！\n那个，请问你们怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1068_051tmg", "source_sha256": "28f04b8204c663795f6b84fc81b620b5a19d70e2a63d2e1a7521002d068d33cd", "ja": "すみません。おふたりの声が聞こえたので、\n気になってしまって……。", "zh": "抱歉。因为听到了两位的声音，就有些在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1069_p", "source_sha256": "19cf230a85c4e3fc6b09c3411092ac88c5bdfe72505f819809935ff099a51f79", "ja": "静香。……紬と星梨花も、心配してくれてたんだ。\nふたりにも、事情を話してもいいか？", "zh": "静香……紬和星梨花也一直在担心你。可以也把事情告诉她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1070_015siz", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1071_p", "source_sha256": "1fda0486d6d7d1e9879dc44b2809802e279902e6365b4f522ebfe4ed59686cea", "ja": "静香は、ご両親との約束で……中学生の間に結果を\n出さないと、アイドルを続けられない事になっている。", "zh": "静香和父母约定好了……如果不能在初中毕业前做出成绩，就不能继续当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1072_p", "source_sha256": "1c53f5bc267d889769adf3f15e8815a1d71483b28bd5e3386be11ecd1f84c1b6", "ja": "それで……静香から新曲の話を聞いたお父さんが、\nそれでは結果として認められないと言っていて……。", "zh": "然后……静香的父亲听说了新歌的事，说这样还不能算是取得了成果……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1073_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e95fbc77d2c6c1df70049bae32f00a8a4b96c07b41f8ca053af6be4a8ce250c8", "ja": "そのような事情が……。その約束が、最上さんを\n追い詰めていたのですね。なんてむごい……。", "zh": "原来还有这样的隐情……正是那个约定，把最上小姐逼入了绝境吧。太残酷了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1074_022ser", "source_sha256": "e3ae1df4bb407d7bc58c64ee4463fe508f1584b6d79b52398ea433a60f807b09", "ja": "そんな……わたし、いやですっ！\n静香さんが、アイドルじゃなくなるなんて……！", "zh": "怎么会……我不要！\n我不想看到静香不再当偶像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1075_p", "source_sha256": "8360787cc6d8d8dbf7053949e1fe94f59b32556a1a6abf5a6215fda25643bfb4", "ja": "もちろん、俺も認めたくない。……だからこそ、\n静香には次の公演で、あの曲を歌ってほしい。", "zh": "我当然也不想承认。……正因如此，\n我才希望静香在下次公演中，能去唱那首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1076_p", "source_sha256": "312abf66e571f80376264718550f68003993a18b5e8971711895e31dd20470ea", "ja": "自分の夢に向かってひたむきに努力する静香にこそ、\nこの歌は似合う。きっと、道が拓けるはずだ。", "zh": "正因为静香一直朝着自己的梦想埋头努力，这首歌才适合她。一定能够开辟出一条道路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1077_p", "source_sha256": "6a39f7e841ce502f19eed5d563c2a4c211cfcab01688f306d6ec12139b6e32f0", "ja": "アイドルの歌が持つ力は、とてつもなく大きい。\n……それは、静香が一番よく知ってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "偶像歌曲所蕴含的力量，是无比巨大的。\n……这一点，静香应该最清楚不过了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1079_015siz", "source_sha256": "7791b37ae6d51ee867e262d9d64f82010250a8cedfb64f610ad1bea0017fa1e3", "ja": "そう、ですね。私……今まで何度も、\n歌に……背中を、押してもらってきました。", "zh": "是这样呢。我……至今已经无数次，  \n被歌声……推着向前走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1080_p", "source_sha256": "3c2523037c3e4f7fa93be7f0ffcbb64c023c0a3781cdfd971526fdb729d79c9d", "ja": "うん。……そしてこれは、静香の歌だ。\n静香自身に力をくれ、導いてくれる歌なんだよ。", "zh": "嗯。……而且这首是静香的歌。\n是能赐予静香力量、指引静香前进的歌啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1081_p", "source_sha256": "0c0eef84fb0c35d7cba50e98b49d7cfa5daf0e498f130956d649bc34fc1199a7", "ja": "……でも、言葉だけじゃ信じるのは難しいよな。\nだから……俺にも、行動で示させてくれ。", "zh": "……不过，光凭嘴上说说很难让人相信吧。\n所以……也让我用实际行动来证明吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1107", "source_sha256": "e64170fce4ec8fcddd8f7c8f3a9d6e6bdd61b3d817280932c56b453d4f58e709", "ja": "スマホを取り出す", "zh": "拿出手机", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1082_se", "source_sha256": "1bc2ab98f6434b7b2501c94300855b7a403544eff6f07920b58ac8388d1c6288", "ja": "トゥルルルル……トゥルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
