{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1084_p", "source_sha256": "2fd33436f95eb1e276447b7276017523148483cf8b291647f0c0bc9522f91c9f", "ja": "……突然すみません、最上さんのお宅ですか？\n765プロの、{$P$}と申します。", "zh": "……冒昧打扰了，请问是最上家吗？\n我是765事务所的{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
