{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1087_050jul", "source_sha256": "529e381900679b370f9a35f61b1ad6d51d8b0a72985ef611c3b71d9003f4e74f", "ja": "{$P$}……ははっ！\nいいぜ、そうこなくっちゃな！", "zh": "{$P$}……哈哈！\n这样才对嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1088_p", "source_sha256": "e4356f81bc4db287a641a2695aa3ca7a463bdbc1137e1d8043b428877a373ce4", "ja": "はい。……では、今週末うかがいます。\nよろしくお願いします。失礼致します……。", "zh": "好的……那么我这周末过去。麻烦您了。那我先挂了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1089_p", "source_sha256": "01a116ee7c5059190c8463ca081551b88b428166151de724f33cd65fff4f7c9a", "ja": "よし、お父さんに時間をもらったぞ。説得が\n上手くいくかどうかは、まだわからないけど……。", "zh": "好，令尊答应抽空见我了。虽然还不知道\n能不能顺利说服他就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
