{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1091_p", "source_sha256": "c45b3c6e53f1691c5bd0b8fa1e81fc0466bf16abde710b88049e9e8cd8b4f287", "ja": "すぐにできるとは限らない。\nでも静香は、次がある事を信じていてくれ。", "zh": "不一定能马上办到。\n但请相信，静香还会有下一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1092_p", "source_sha256": "0778bb0b687dbf57824f4cef3917790e70b3c3e1a046977bdb86898266203325", "ja": "俺が必ず、静香の次のステージを用意する。\n絶対にだ。約束するよ。", "zh": "我一定会为静香准备好下一次舞台。\n绝对会。约好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1093_015siz", "source_sha256": "c70854046a80d060cca22ba7fcd416a46df35444eaeb895f553fe1577a572bd7", "ja": "……っ。{$P$}……。", "zh": "……{$P$}……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1094_p", "source_sha256": "83868296e8acd9e730d2774b7e5415880c785e740543e845295183781af36d32", "ja": "だから信じて、前を向いていて欲しい。静香が\nアイドルを辞めたいといわない限り、奪わせない。", "zh": "所以，请相信我，抬头向前看。只要静香不说想放弃偶像，我就不会让任何人夺走这一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1095_p", "source_sha256": "28f9a8c2b1d8db9873f380da865184cf09a3e3be20dfef209f1a591725e13926", "ja": "アイドルの夢は絶対に守る。\nそれが、プロデューサーの仕事だからな！", "zh": "我绝对会守护你的偶像梦想。\n因为那就是制作人的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1096_015siz", "source_sha256": "cdc73b578a1bc5687a97c631d990cabc9efd0aab23097d48da8acaf397f252ab", "ja": "突然、父に連絡するなんて……もう。\n{$P$}……。", "zh": "突然联系父亲什么的……真是的。\n{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1097_014mir", "source_sha256": "46dd8ad98b2baec1d292d3042b460e250e376ae8878ac909b0cb6de97f4fc5b2", "ja": "静香ちゃ～～～ん！\nよかった、よかったよぉ～……！", "zh": "静香——！太好了，真的太好了——……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1098_050jul", "source_sha256": "3b11a2f5a6925188d3be1f596b594e29a9096887610b5ba8a1b151530b8f7d88", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。{$P$}がいれば、\n大丈夫だ！　そうだろ？　バカP！", "zh": "啊，是啊。只要有{$P$}在，就没问题！对吧，笨蛋P！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1099_022ser", "source_sha256": "d6925b50e652470941728b01053974df243b94d0310a167e52ecc2b63846d835", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n静香さんのこと、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n请多多关照静香小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1100_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3abc5dce2d896ed1297bb937c30a923e23f88f703e969a9318c040a7584ebf1f", "ja": "あなたの肩にかかっているのですよ。\nお願いしますね。", "zh": "这可是托付在您肩上的重任哦。\n拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1101_p", "source_sha256": "7eeb322433a172c27f994c623399a928a488fb81d5757b4c12dd798f061190c2", "ja": "もちろんだ。約束を撤回させるまで、諦めるもんか。\n説得できるまで、何度だって話をするさ。", "zh": "那是当然。在让他撤回约定之前，我绝不会放弃。\n我会一直和他谈下去，直到说服他为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1102_015siz", "source_sha256": "cf0bb8ac8d409bfd139a078ed9eaaf19c931316103ac0dbb24b6631efbbd183c", "ja": "未来、ジュリアさん……星梨花、紬さんも。\n心配かけてごめんなさい。でも、もう大丈夫だから。", "zh": "未来、茱莉亚先生……星梨花、紬姐也。\n让你们担心了，对不起。不过，我已经没事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1103_015siz", "source_sha256": "aa48502731092682794e41157153af0e384bf07ddefb206d3e02532c7b7eaefc", "ja": "{$P$}。私……\n{$P$}の言葉を、信じます。", "zh": "{$P$}。我……相信{$P$}说的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1104_015siz", "source_sha256": "47b030df62593ff82a0c472d5147377ef554aa4ce5aa44af7ea4f853fa89be07", "ja": "だから、私は私のやるべきことをしなくちゃ。\n次の公演……絶対に、結果を出してみせます！", "zh": "所以，我必须做好自己该做的事。\n下一场公演……我一定会拿出成果给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1105_p", "source_sha256": "bbf4f4381b0f679fde0e19058a51cdaf8cb5ec3f14f0b04a3521d5120a4fa6e2", "ja": "（静香の顔に、ようやく笑みが戻った。この笑顔を\n……アイドルの夢を守れるのは、俺しかいないんだ）", "zh": "（静香脸上终于重新露出了笑容。能守护这份笑容……守护她成为偶像的梦想的人，只有我。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_067_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_067_1106_p", "source_sha256": "0f0eb080715f98302c2a35c01d3db2656490fc4868888dccd2d718ee50053e27", "ja": "（いつもとは違う気合いを入れて、臨まないと。\n静香の……静香を思う、すべての人のためにも！）", "zh": "（必须拿出和平时不同的干劲来面对才行。\n为了静香……也为了所有牵挂着静香的人！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
